          "title": "Matrices and Transformations",
          "body": "Transformations include translation, reflection, rotation and enlargement. Translation by vector (a,b)\nmaps (x,y) to (x+a,y+b). A matrix maps a point vector to a new point. For a 2 × 2 matrix [[a,b],[c,d]],\ndeterminant = ad − bc; the absolute determinant is the area scale factor."
        }
